Function TemporalDifferenceLearning(NumEpisodes, Alpha, Gamma)
    Initialize StateValues hash map or array with 0.0
    For episode = 1 To NumEpisodes Do
        Initialize CurrentState to GetInitialState()
        While CurrentState is not Terminal Do
            Select Action using Policy
            Execute Action, Observe Reward and NextState
            If NextState is Terminal Then
                Target = Reward
            Else
                Target = Reward + Gamma * StateValues[NextState]
            End If
            StateValues[CurrentState] = StateValues[CurrentState] + Alpha * (Target - StateValues[CurrentState])
            CurrentState = NextState
        End While
    End For
    Display StateValues
End Function
